  "listing": {
    "tagline": "Run your social content like a studio — pages per channel, reel intelligence, scripts and a CMO agent.",
    "description": "**Content Studio** turns InfiniBot into a content operations desk.\n\n- **Content pages** — one page per channel (Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, LinkedIn…) with scripts, videos, content and ideas databases, goals, brand voice and live insights.\n- **Connections** — connect Instagram (Graph API token) for live follower and reach stats, and ManyChat for DM automation. A connection only shows as connected once the service accepted your key.\n- **Content Intelligence** — your reel library with metrics, transcripts, viral-format scoring against niche benchmarks, AI insights and a trends radar.\n- **Scripts** — generate and refine scripts grounded in research and your saved viral examples.\n- **Agents** — the CMO, Content Director, Scriptwriter, Brand Designer and Video Editor join your roster while the plugin is on.\n\nTurning the plugin off hides every page and stops the background sync; your data stays where it is.",
    "category": "apps",
    "tags": [
      "content",
      "social",
      "instagram",
      "scripts",
      "marketing"
    ],
